---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Galeria
description: Realizacje tartaku Drewitar – więźby dachowe, wiązary, elewacje i transport drewna.
---
<section class="page-head grid-bg"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow reveal"><span class="dot"></span>Realizacje</p>
  <h1 class="reveal">Galeria</h1>
  <p class="lead reveal">Więcej zdjęć i filmów na naszym <a href="{{ company.facebook }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">profilu na Facebooku</a>.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="gallery">
  {% for g in gallery %}
  <a class="gallery-item reveal{% if g.wide %} wide{% endif %}" style="--d:{{ (loop.index0 % 3) * 0.08 }}s" href="{{ g.src }}" data-lightbox>
    <img src="{{ g.thumb }}" alt="{{ g.alt }}" width="{{ 800 if g.wide else 600 }}" height="400" loading="lazy">
  </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div></section>
{% include "partials/videos.njk" %}
<dialog class="lightbox" aria-label="Podgląd zdjęcia"><button type="button" class="lightbox-close" aria-label="Zamknij">×</button><img src="data:," alt=""></dialog>
